WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.713 --> 00:00:20.197
Sign in as the business owner.

2
00:00:20.297 --> 00:00:26.543
Open Inventory, then Products. Every item you sell is listed here with its price, stock and status.

3
00:00:26.643 --> 00:00:32.175
The tabs at the top split the catalogue into All, Active, Draft and Archived products.

4
00:00:32.276 --> 00:00:36.609
Switch to Grid to see the products as cards with their pictures.

5
00:00:38.511 --> 00:00:41.516
Switch back to List for a compact table.

6
00:00:41.616 --> 00:00:46.652
Search by name, SKU or barcode. Type a few letters and the list narrows down.

7
00:00:49.088 --> 00:00:54.178
Filters narrow the list by category, brand, unit, product type or stock level.

8
00:00:59.111 --> 00:01:02.072
To add a product, click New product.

9
00:01:02.173 --> 00:01:07.264
Start with the name. Keep it the way customers and cashiers will recognise it.

10
00:01:07.364 --> 00:01:12.674
A simple product has a single price and stock count. Variable products come later.

11
00:01:12.774 --> 00:01:16.711
Click the sparkle button to generate a SKU automatically.

12
00:01:16.811 --> 00:01:21.903
Do the same for the barcode, if the product has none printed on its packaging.

13
00:01:22.003 --> 00:01:26.159
Enter what the product costs you and how many you start with.

14
00:01:26.259 --> 00:01:30.469
Set the selling price. This is what customers pay at the till.

15
00:01:30.569 --> 00:01:34.136
Choose the tax group that applies to this product.

16
00:01:34.236 --> 00:01:37.333
Pick the category the product belongs to.

17
00:01:37.433 --> 00:01:40.381
Then the sub category, if there is one.

18
00:01:41.300 --> 00:01:47.217
Click Save product. Use Save as draft instead if it is not ready to sell.

19
00:01:49.122 --> 00:01:53.124
Find your new product in the list by searching for it.

20
00:01:54.741 --> 00:01:58.881
Click the eye icon to open the product and see its details.

21
00:02:01.189 --> 00:02:05.839
Click Edit to change anything: price, tax, category or stock settings.

22
00:02:05.939 --> 00:02:08.554
Raise the selling price a little.

23
00:02:08.654 --> 00:02:13.347
Save the changes.

24
00:02:15.649 --> 00:02:21.620
Your product is ready to sell. Next, organise the catalogue with categories, brands and units.
